      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\ncaption_embedding.py - Embed caption chunks for semantic meeting search\nlive_caption_safety.py - Check live transcript text for unsafe content\nlive_caption_translate.py - Translate live captions into another language\nmeeting_summary.py - Summarize live meeting transcript chunks\npartial_results.py - handles partial and final streaming recognition events\nspeech_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Streaming Speech-to-Text\nspeech_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Streaming Speech-to-Text\nstream_chunks.py - streams audio chunks from an async source\nstream_microphone.py - streams microphone audio and yields interim transcripts\nstream_with_language.py - starts a streaming recognizer with language and punctuation settings\n\nCreate stream_microphone.py in the current working directory.\nTask: streams microphone audio and yields interim transcripts.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
