      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `stream_microphone.py` file that streams microphone audio and yields interim transcripts, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API, which is a well-known service for converting audio to text. The integration will be identifiable by the import of the `google.cloud.speech` module and the use of the `SpeechClient` class from this module. </thinking>\n",
